{
 "tool_name": "verify_route",
 "arguments": {
   "route": "<json string>"
 }
}

But the required format is as earlier: <action>verify_route</action> and <action_input>{"route":"..."} </action_input>. Need proper JSON without extra quotes. The route string should be a JSON string, need to escape inner quotes. My previous had extra outer quotes. Should be:

{
 "route": "{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"Cc1ccc(C(=O)C(C)(C)C)cc1\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"reaction\",\"template_id\":6889,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"CC(C)(C)C(=O)Cl\"},{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"Cc1ccc(Br)cc1\"}]}]}"
